@startuml
title SD-08 - Report Generation
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Authorized User" as P0
participant "Reports UI" as P1
participant "Report Service" as P2
participant "Report Repository" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
P0 -> P1 : Select report + filters
P1 -> P2 : generateReport(type,filters)
P2 -> P2 : Authorize report type and row scope
P2 -> P3 : queryAuthorizedData(filters)
P3 -> P4 : SELECT filtered permitted records
P4 -> P3 : Result set
P3 -> P2 : Authorized data
P2 -> P2 : Format report; enforce field restrictions
P2 -> P1 : Report preview / empty result
P1 -> P0 : Preview or print/export if permitted
@enduml
